  Data sources (web → native P1/S8 source seam):
    transitions/fsmType/windowMinutes/anchor/selectedId/lastTransition/widerPreset props
      (parent-owned, pre-windowed by windowTransitions.ts) → StateTimelineSource → StateTimelineUpdate
