    useDateFormat (formatTime/formatRelative)→ StateTimelineFormat (pure, injected locale/tz/now)
  Verbatim web logic ported + unit-pinned (the `useMemo` body):
    endTs = (anchor ?? now) · startTs = endTs − windowMinutes·60_000 · span = (endTs−startTs)||1 ·
    sorted = stable ascending by ts · leftPct = ((ts−startTs)/span)·100 (UNCLAMPED) ·
    dot hue = getStateColor(fsmType, to_state) → FSMRegistry.color(for:state:) (lowercased,
    vehicle/neutral fallbacks) · presetLabel min<60 "%lld min" / min<1440 "%lld h" (round) / "24 h".
